  "worked_solution": "To find the range of $x,$ we can start by completing the square, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={t}^{2}-2t \\\\  & ={(t-1)}^{2}-{(1)}^{2} \\\\  & ={(t-1)}^{2}-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince ${(t-1)}^{2}\\ge 0,$ we can conclude that $x\\ge -1.$",
